---
layout: base.njk
title: Kontakt
description: Opony Mateczny, ul. Marii Konopnickiej 82, Kraków (rondo Matecznego). Telefony, e-mail i godziny otwarcia.
permalink: /kontakt/
---
<section class="page">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h1>Kontakt</h1>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>Tu jesteśmy</h2>
        <p class="address"><strong>{{ site.city | upper }}, {{ site.street }}</strong><br>({{ site.landmark }})</p>
        <p><a class="btn" href="{{ site.map_url }}" rel="noopener">Pokaż na mapie</a></p>
        {{ home.directions | md | safe }}
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Telefony</h2>
        <p class="phones">
          {%- for p in site.phones %}<a href="{{ p.number | tel }}">{{ p.number }}</a><br>{% endfor %}
          Biuro: <a href="{{ site.office_phone | tel }}">{{ site.office_phone }}</a>
        </p>
        <h2>E-mail</h2>
        <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <h2>Godziny otwarcia</h2>
        <p>Poniedziałek–piątek: <strong>{{ site.hours_weekdays }}</strong><br>Sobota: <strong>{{ site.hours_saturday }}</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
